WEBVTT

00:00:01.660 --> 00:00:03.670
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:06.000
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:00:06.340 --> 00:00:08.800
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:20.470
<b>Kinou made no ruuru kyou wa tada no ruuzu</b>

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:20.470
<i>Yesterday’s rules are simply loose today</i>

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:24.520
<b>Kowashite dantotsu gooru</b>

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:24.520
<i>The best goal is to break them</i>

00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:27.560
<b>hashiri tudukete nai to</b>

00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:27.560
<i>If I don’t keep running</i>

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.940
<b>hokani imi wa nai to</b>

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.940
<i>There’s no other meaning</i>

00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:34.150
<b>Panku na tetsukaku nanda</b>

00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:34.150
<i>It’s a punk philosophy</i>

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:39.330
<b>Baiorizumu wa tsuubai rizumu de</b>

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:39.330
<i>Biorhythm is a two-time rhythm</i>

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.370
<b>Fuukei wa shunkan ni musuu no sen</b>

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.370
<i>The scenery instantly becomes countless lines</i>

00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:46.330
<b>Ore wo torimaku kaze</b>

00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:46.330
<i>The wind envelops me</i>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.050
<b>Inside Outside semete</b>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.050
<i>Inside Outside attack</i>

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.420
<b>Issai gassai nuite</b>

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.420
<i>Surpass everything altogether</i>

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:55.430
<b>Dare hitori monani hitotsu mo</b>

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:58.140
<i>I won’t let no one and nothing go forward</i>

00:00:55.430 --> 00:00:58.140
<b>Mae wo ikasetaku wa nai</b>

00:00:58.140 --> 00:01:00.470
<b>Inside Outside GO! SONIC!!</b>

00:00:58.140 --> 00:01:00.470
<i>Inside Outside, Go! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:00.470 --> 00:01:02.850
<b>Issai gassai Yes! SONIC!!</b>

00:01:00.470 --> 00:01:02.850
<i>Everything altogether Yes! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:06.020
<b>Abunai yo to Have A Nice wa niteru</b>

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:06.020
<i>“Watch out” and “Have a nice” are similar</i>

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:08.670
<b>Soudochira mo kamihitoe na no sa</b>

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:08.670
<i>That’s right – both are by the skin of your teeth</i>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:17.160
<b>Taikutsu nugisuteteima sugu kakedase</b>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:17.160
<i>Throw boredom away and start running right now</i>

00:01:20.530 --> 00:01:22.290
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:24.750
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:28.460
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:01:30.520 --> 00:01:34.690
The grand opening of Emerald Coast Resort.

00:01:35.320 --> 00:01:38.780
White sand beaches and the blue sea.

00:01:38.950 --> 00:01:45.830
After diving and taking a tour on a cruise, it's dinner at a luxurious restaurant at a hotel by the sea.

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:49.380
This is the ocean resort of our dreams.

00:01:49.540 --> 00:01:52.420
Let's enjoy it to our hearts' content.

00:01:52.420 --> 00:01:54.460
This is my first trip to the beach.

00:01:54.590 --> 00:01:56.840
It's exciting, isn't it, Cheese?

00:01:58.510 --> 00:02:02.640
The engine is fine. Verifying course to Emerald Coast.

00:02:02.970 --> 00:02:06.390
Please don't get too carried away, okay?

00:02:06.520 --> 00:02:12.690
As long as they stay within the boundaries of our villa, no one will see them.

00:02:12.940 --> 00:02:15.780
I'm worried about what may happen while I'm away.

00:02:16.650 --> 00:02:19.410
All you have to do is show up for the party.

00:02:20.320 --> 00:02:24.410
You're only going in Lindsey's place, so I don't see any problem in leaving early.

00:02:24.740 --> 00:02:25.410
Really?

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:28.250
Sonic, let's go swimming later.

00:02:28.910 --> 00:02:32.290
What's so fun about a big puddle of water?

00:02:34.750 --> 00:02:37.720
Sonic, you're really not going?

00:02:37.720 --> 00:02:40.340
You guys go and enjoy yourselves.

00:02:43.430 --> 00:02:47.600
I wonder if Sonic doesn't like going out with us.

00:02:48.140 --> 00:02:53.360
That's not it. He doesn't like the ocean because he can't swim.

00:03:03.780 --> 00:03:05.160
Oh yeah.

00:03:05.790 --> 00:03:09.540
Sonic doesn't like places he can't run through.

00:03:10.920 --> 00:03:14.250
I wonder when we can go on a date at the beach.

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:21.180
Chris! You need to get going or you'll be late for the ceremony!

00:03:21.550 --> 00:03:23.140
They're calling for you.

00:03:25.050 --> 00:03:26.310
I'll see you later.

00:03:26.720 --> 00:03:28.430
Please come as soon as you can.

00:03:28.600 --> 00:03:29.730
We'll be waiting for you.

00:03:31.850 --> 00:03:35.480
Good luck keeping the adults company.

00:03:56.670 --> 00:03:59.210
X-Tornado, go!

00:04:11.430 --> 00:04:12.810
Take off!

00:04:24.240 --> 00:04:26.070
Hang in there, Chris.

00:04:39.340 --> 00:04:43.760
Chris, this is one of your duties as a member of the Thorndyke family.

00:04:44.130 --> 00:04:46.220
I know, Mr. Tanaka.

00:04:54.730 --> 00:04:56.690
This sure is better than the beach.

00:04:59.010 --> 00:05:04.050
Episode 9

00:04:59.010 --> 00:05:04.050
Amy on the Beach

00:05:43.690 --> 00:05:46.110
It's really beautiful down there!

00:05:46.490 --> 00:05:49.990
This is a nice place. I'm glad we came.

00:05:50.240 --> 00:05:53.200
It would be nice if Chris and the others could join us.

00:06:06.840 --> 00:06:09.390
Chris, say hello.

00:06:11.930 --> 00:06:13.470
Are you all right?

00:06:28.200 --> 00:06:29.570
It's beautiful.

00:06:30.360 --> 00:06:33.280
I wish Sonic was here with me.

00:06:42.840 --> 00:06:43.500
Amy.

00:06:43.670 --> 00:06:44.630
Sonic.

00:07:00.310 --> 00:07:03.730
Oh my, oh my! What's gotten into me?

00:07:03.730 --> 00:07:06.650
How embarrassing!

00:07:14.660 --> 00:07:17.950
Just when I was having great fantasies!

00:07:41.190 --> 00:07:46.440
Oops, I guess I became too heated.

00:07:49.780 --> 00:07:51.610
Oh my. Really?

00:07:51.610 --> 00:07:52.610
That's right.

00:07:54.990 --> 00:07:59.910
Stupid Sonic!

00:08:03.870 --> 00:08:05.540
What kind of lucky charm is that?

00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:07.800
It makes you a better swimmer.

00:08:10.840 --> 00:08:12.130
Really?

00:08:12.720 --> 00:08:14.510
I made it with all my heart.

00:08:14.840 --> 00:08:16.350
So please treasure it.

00:08:16.550 --> 00:08:17.350
Thank you.

00:08:18.430 --> 00:08:20.220
Okay, let's go for a swim!

00:08:20.390 --> 00:08:22.980
Hey, wait for me!

00:08:29.190 --> 00:08:31.940
I wonder if this will do.

00:08:33.610 --> 00:08:35.610
What are you making?

00:08:37.530 --> 00:08:39.240
N-Nothing.

00:08:39.700 --> 00:08:42.120
It's a present for Sonic, isn't it?

00:08:42.540 --> 00:08:44.290
No, it's not!

00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:05.560
Starting now, I'm going to transform this place into the best resort!

00:09:13.490 --> 00:09:16.410
Remodeling troops! Forward!

00:09:16.490 --> 00:09:17.660
All right!

00:09:17.820 --> 00:09:19.120
Ready!

00:09:19.240 --> 00:09:20.410
Here I go!

00:09:21.040 --> 00:09:30.210
Here we come to destroy everything!

00:09:30.250 --> 00:09:34.720
Here we go! Here we go! Here we go go go!

00:09:37.550 --> 00:09:41.430
It's destroyed!

00:09:48.100 --> 00:09:50.060
I have to contact Sonic!

00:09:52.190 --> 00:09:58.530
You're Eggman Sea Park's first guests. I'm not letting you escape!

00:10:01.080 --> 00:10:08.420
Chris, I will risk my life to protect you, even if that means I must die.

00:10:10.130 --> 00:10:12.920
I am prepared to make this my final resting place.

00:10:14.840 --> 00:10:17.090
You don't need to prepare anything like that.

00:10:17.130 --> 00:10:19.680
We have no choice but to stay still for awhile.

00:10:20.510 --> 00:10:23.850
That's right. Listen to Ella.

00:10:27.020 --> 00:10:28.230
Hey!

00:10:32.020 --> 00:10:34.690
They're still playing at the water puddle?

00:10:34.980 --> 00:10:36.740
What a drag.

00:10:38.200 --> 00:10:41.490
It's so beautiful! It's just the thing for this room!

00:10:41.660 --> 00:10:45.080
What a waste that nobody is here at a time like this.

00:10:45.910 --> 00:10:48.250
Sonic! You're home!

00:10:48.910 --> 00:10:49.620
What?

00:10:52.210 --> 00:10:57.420
Many mysterious destroyers appeared on Emerald Coast and attacked various facilities, such as the hotel.

00:10:57.550 --> 00:11:00.470
They are also destroying nearby areas.

00:11:00.470 --> 00:11:03.010
People are being evacuated from the area.

00:11:07.350 --> 00:11:15.070
I'm transforming these lame facilities into the ultimate amusement park.

00:11:15.070 --> 00:11:18.440
It will be called Eggman Sea Park!

00:11:20.450 --> 00:11:25.450
We know you don't like water, so we have a lot of traps specifically tailored for you.

00:11:25.830 --> 00:11:27.410
You have to come.

00:11:27.540 --> 00:11:30.960
As usual, here's a present for you.

00:11:33.880 --> 00:11:36.250
Ha ha ha!

00:11:41.630 --> 00:11:43.050
The ocean...

00:12:09.620 --> 00:12:11.120
It's Eggman!

00:12:12.410 --> 00:12:13.920
Move out of the way!

00:12:14.540 --> 00:12:16.080
Chris is in danger!

00:12:21.010 --> 00:12:22.670
Stay back at the villa!

00:12:23.300 --> 00:12:27.760
I know Sonic is definitely coming. I go wherever Sonic goes.

00:12:29.720 --> 00:12:32.180
Okay. Hang on tight.

00:12:44.360 --> 00:12:46.320
Please be careful.

00:12:50.870 --> 00:12:51.910
Excellent.

00:12:51.910 --> 00:12:56.420
Now put a Ferris wheel and a pinball machine there.

00:12:56.630 --> 00:13:00.050
I don't want to keep all the fun for myself.

00:13:12.220 --> 00:13:13.180
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:13:14.350 --> 00:13:15.350
Sonic!

00:13:15.850 --> 00:13:18.400
Hey guys! Are you all right?

00:13:20.770 --> 00:13:22.940
So you finally came, Sonic!

00:13:24.070 --> 00:13:27.450
Today will be your last day alive!

00:13:28.160 --> 00:13:29.410
E-38!

00:13:31.490 --> 00:13:32.540
Here I go!

00:13:45.550 --> 00:13:47.180
You've fallen into my trap!

00:13:47.510 --> 00:13:49.850
Damn, I can't get free!

00:13:54.520 --> 00:13:55.640
Sonic!

00:13:58.650 --> 00:14:02.730
This is my latest invention, Super Soft Alloy!

00:14:09.530 --> 00:14:11.160
Do you give up?

00:14:15.370 --> 00:14:16.620
Well done.

00:14:17.620 --> 00:14:20.540
Enjoy the water again!

00:14:32.390 --> 00:14:35.640
Brace yourself, E-83! Don't let him run!

00:14:35.890 --> 00:14:38.940
Drag Sonic into the water!

00:14:55.080 --> 00:15:00.830
Pull him! Drag him! Don't lose to him!

00:15:01.040 --> 00:15:01.750
Sonic!

00:15:05.800 --> 00:15:06.760
Amy!

00:15:07.210 --> 00:15:09.800
Sonic!

00:15:23.770 --> 00:15:25.150
What do you think you're doing?

00:15:26.110 --> 00:15:30.150
How dare you do this! Sonic hates the ocean!

00:15:31.320 --> 00:15:32.740
Amy, thanks!

00:15:37.910 --> 00:15:39.500
Sonic!

00:15:44.080 --> 00:15:45.090
Got it!

00:16:03.480 --> 00:16:05.060
Oh no!

00:16:12.950 --> 00:16:14.200
Sonic!

00:16:14.570 --> 00:16:15.780
Cut it out!

00:16:17.330 --> 00:16:18.330
How dare you!

00:16:19.240 --> 00:16:20.750
You'll pay for this!

00:16:21.200 --> 00:16:22.500
See you later!

00:16:24.920 --> 00:16:26.330
You're too reckless!

00:16:26.880 --> 00:16:30.010
I couldn't help it. My body acted on its own.

00:16:32.550 --> 00:16:34.430
Are you both okay?

00:16:35.220 --> 00:16:36.720
Of course!

00:16:39.470 --> 00:16:40.270
Thanks, Amy.

00:16:40.850 --> 00:16:41.850
Wait!

00:16:43.390 --> 00:16:46.520
This is a lucky charm that will help you become a good swimmer.

00:16:52.030 --> 00:16:53.780
That's only superstition, isn't it?

00:16:54.400 --> 00:16:57.320
Probably, but I made it anyways.

00:16:58.580 --> 00:16:59.990
You made it, Amy?

00:17:13.590 --> 00:17:14.590
The bracelet!

00:17:18.180 --> 00:17:19.850
My bracelet!

00:17:28.060 --> 00:17:31.610
Don't think it's all over yet.

00:17:32.320 --> 00:17:36.740
This is what remodeling robot E-39 looks like when it combines!

00:17:37.490 --> 00:17:41.990
You're back already? You sure are busy this week.

00:17:42.160 --> 00:17:43.450
You're a hard worker.

00:17:43.750 --> 00:17:46.790
Shut up! You're such an irritating hedgehog!

00:17:47.460 --> 00:17:51.250
Centipede, come towards the sound of clapping!

00:17:52.340 --> 00:17:55.920
Go get him, Demolition robot E-39!

00:17:56.880 --> 00:18:00.640
This way! Come towards the sound of clapping!

00:18:11.650 --> 00:18:15.240
My bracelet...

00:18:32.290 --> 00:18:38.340
Go, E-39! Twist and squeeze Sonic!

00:18:38.340 --> 00:18:42.430
How dare you do something like this!

00:18:45.310 --> 00:18:47.810
How dare you! How dare you!

00:18:50.980 --> 00:18:53.440
Ouch!

00:18:53.730 --> 00:18:54.690
Amy...

00:18:55.610 --> 00:18:56.900
What?

00:18:58.530 --> 00:19:01.910
How dare you do this!

00:19:19.840 --> 00:19:25.100
You're scaring me! Why are you doing this?

00:19:29.390 --> 00:19:32.100
Take that and that and that!

00:19:50.710 --> 00:19:54.040
Take this!

00:20:02.510 --> 00:20:03.340
Amy!

00:20:13.230 --> 00:20:16.230
Sonic, what do you think you're doing? You can't swim!

00:20:16.730 --> 00:20:17.770
Sonic!

00:20:30.120 --> 00:20:33.420
No, Sonic. You can't swim...

00:20:58.360 --> 00:21:01.440
Wait up, Sonic.

00:21:05.070 --> 00:21:06.990
I said wait!

00:21:20.170 --> 00:21:21.050
Amy.

00:21:24.380 --> 00:21:27.510
Amy! I'm so glad!

00:21:28.800 --> 00:21:29.800
I...

00:21:30.310 --> 00:21:35.690
We were worried about you. Please don't be so reckless.

00:21:36.940 --> 00:21:38.230
Where am I?

00:21:40.190 --> 00:21:42.530
Mr. Chris' villa.

00:21:44.570 --> 00:21:46.320
Where's Sonic?

00:21:47.280 --> 00:21:49.780
He already left.

00:21:53.200 --> 00:21:54.290
I see.

00:21:58.080 --> 00:21:59.750
The bracelet...

00:22:01.630 --> 00:22:03.050
I lost it.

00:22:06.050 --> 00:22:07.130
Amy...

00:22:09.300 --> 00:22:11.260
But I'll make another one.

00:22:12.310 --> 00:22:17.600
Unless Sonic learns how to swim, we can't come to the beach together.

00:22:18.480 --> 00:22:20.730
That's the spirit, Amy!

00:22:31.620 --> 00:22:34.540
It's about time I go home.

00:22:44.920 --> 00:22:48.760
<b>Tabidatsu junbi wa dekita kai?</b>

00:22:44.920 --> 00:22:48.760
<i>Are you ready to go on a journey?</i>

00:22:48.760 --> 00:22:52.010
<b>mata hitotsu asa ga kuru</b>

00:22:48.760 --> 00:22:52.010
<i>Another morning has arrived</i>

00:22:52.010 --> 00:22:55.540
<b>Atarashii shatsu ni kigaete</b>

00:22:52.010 --> 00:22:55.540
<i>Change into a new shirt</i>

00:22:55.540 --> 00:22:59.040
<b>Kurayami wo nukedasou</b>

00:22:55.540 --> 00:22:59.040
<i>And escape the darkness</i>

00:22:59.040 --> 00:23:02.480
<b>Nemuranai machi wa kyou mo</b>

00:22:59.040 --> 00:23:06.650
<i>The sleepless city quietly watches over you again today</i>

00:23:02.480 --> 00:23:06.650
<b>Shizuka ni tada mimamotteiru</b>

00:23:09.380 --> 00:23:12.660
<b>Kimi to boku ga hajimatteyuku!</b>

00:23:09.380 --> 00:23:12.660
<i>We begin to go!</i>

00:23:12.660 --> 00:23:16.290
<b>To be shine, To be free</b>

00:23:16.290 --> 00:23:19.000
<b>Tomadowanai de</b>

00:23:16.290 --> 00:23:19.000
<i>Don't be bewildered</i>

00:23:19.660 --> 00:23:25.920
<b>Toki no nami wa tsuyoku yasashii</b>

00:23:19.660 --> 00:23:25.920
<i>The waves of time are strong and kind</i>

00:23:26.800 --> 00:23:30.970
<b>Sugu ni sugu ni kimi wo mukae ni yuku</b>

00:23:26.800 --> 00:23:30.970
<i>I will come quickly to meet you</i>

00:23:33.780 --> 00:23:37.080
<b>Kimi to boku no sekai wo terasou</b>

00:23:33.780 --> 00:23:37.080
<i>Shine a light on our world</i>

00:23:37.080 --> 00:23:40.600
<b>To be shine, To be free</b>

00:23:40.600 --> 00:23:44.110
<b>Kowagaranai de</b>

00:23:40.600 --> 00:23:44.110
<i>Don't be scared</i>

00:23:44.110 --> 00:23:50.280
<b>Toki no nami wa tsuyoku yasashii</b>

00:23:44.110 --> 00:23:50.280
<i>The waves of time are strong and kind</i>

00:23:51.200 --> 00:23:54.680
<b>Haruka tooi michi no mukou gawa e</b>

00:23:51.200 --> 00:23:54.680
<i>At the other end of the very long road</i>

00:23:54.680 --> 00:23:58.160
<b>Sugu ni sugu ni kimi wo mukae ni yuku</b>

00:23:54.680 --> 00:23:58.160
<i>I will come quickly to meet you</i>

00:23:58.160 --> 00:24:02.290
<b>Kimi to boku no mirai mitsukeyou ze</b>

00:23:58.160 --> 00:24:02.290
<i>Let's find our future</i>

00:24:30.670 --> 00:25:35.350
Fierce Fight! Sonic Baseball Team
